        <mxCell id="c3_title" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;EQAI Mobile Application — C3: Component Diagram&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px&quot;&gt;Android 7-Band EQ Runtime Intermediary Pipeline: Flutter Thin UI Shell (Riverpod + CustomPainter), TFLite Isolate, Rust Core (libeqai_math.so via flutter_rust_bridge), SQLite, and Direct jni-rs DynamicsProcessing&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#08427B;strokeColor=#052E56;fontColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=20;spacingRight=20;" vertex="1" parent="1">
